# ── This file is intentionally (almost) empty ───────────────────────────
# The app requires ZERO configuration and ZERO API keys to run.
# Copy to `.env.local` only if you need to override the canonical site URL.

# Canonical origin used for OpenGraph/Twitter cards, robots.txt and sitemap.xml.
# On Vercel this is auto-detected from VERCEL_PROJECT_PRODUCTION_URL, so you
# normally do not need to set it. Set it locally to preview share metadata:
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000
